WEBVTT

00:10:28.874 --> 00:10:32.586
the sole responsibility
of families or of religion.

00:10:32.628 --> 00:10:34.129
(Applause)

00:10:38.008 --> 00:10:41.887
Now, some of you may be thinking
that all of this is too hard.

00:10:42.763 --> 00:10:44.473
That this is unrealistic.

00:10:45.974 --> 00:10:48.811
And I can understand that.
I've been doing this a long time.

00:10:50.145 --> 00:10:52.898
Let's stop worrying about being realistic.

00:10:52.898 --> 00:10:54.692
(Applause)

00:10:56.485 --> 00:10:57.861
Last year, folks,

00:10:57.861 --> 00:11:03.992
we invested 621 billion dollars
globally in startups,